## Why This Is Asked
Tests on-device ML design under strict latency, privacy, and fairness constraints; requires end-to-end thinking from data flow to deployment.

## Key Concepts
- Edge ML and latency budgets
- Federated learning with DP
- Model compression (quantization/pruning)
- Fairness-aware ranking
- Rollback and drift monitoring

## Code Example
```javascript
// Latency check scaffold (pseudo)
function measureLatency(model, input){
  const t0 = performance.now();
  model.infer(input);
  const t1 = performance.now();
  return t1 - t0;
}
``` 

